# Security Policy ## Reporting a Vulnerability If you discover a security vulnerability in
**{{package.name}}**, please do **not** open a public GitHub issue. Instead, report it privately:
{{#if package.repository}} - Open a [GitHub Security
Advisory]({{package.repository}}/security/advisories/new) {{else}} - Contact the maintainer directly
{{/if}} Please include: - A description of the vulnerability - Steps to reproduce the issue -
Potential impact - Any suggested fixes (optional) We will acknowledge your report within **48
hours** and aim to release a fix within **7 days** for critical issues. --- ## Supported Versions |
Version | Supported | | ------- | --------- | | latest | ✔ | --- ## Security Best Practices When
using **{{package.name}}**: - Always use the latest version - Review dependency updates regularly -
Never use untrusted input without validation
